e},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:15:08Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-04T12:13:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T23:30:17Z","closed_at":"2026-09-04T23:30:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: Godot v4.8.dev4, \nNot Reproducible in Godot v4.8 dev3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev4 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (3840x2160 @ 143.99 Hz) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1656) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14700KF (28 threads) - 31.79 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nwhen you want to move a newly inserted node from the bottom of the hierarchy to the top, if the scene is big and complex enough hierarchy with different nodes, in the process of dragging it to the top you end up crashing Godot when your hovering over another node. I haven't been able to reproduce it in v4.8 dev3 but the bug might still exist, sometimes you can replicate the bug quite quickly and easily in dev4, other times it takes really long to replicate it\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f67e067-3af1-41aa-a73d-b7fccbdd960a\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ea3387b-9828-49d3-b559-f8a29d459886\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13389c12-998c-40c4-86dc-47bccf934849\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nstep 1. Open a Scene\nstep 2. Add a few nodes \nstep 3: drag and hold one node\nstep 4: continuously scrub up and down the scene hierarchy and eventually once you stop on a node it will cause a crash\n\nanother way to reproduce is just to add loads of nodes in the scene and just drag a node from the bottom to the top and eventually it will crash\nthe scrubbing is not needed for it to crash just add loads of node with different hierarchies and move a node from the bottom to top normally\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123186/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}